nistrator.\r\nevt-00757|4658|2026-05-06T00:01:51.095Z|The handle to an object was closed.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject :\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-4107722679-1012484280-3777968168-1104\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tm.ward\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x163D26\r\r\n\r\r\nObject:\r\r\n\tObject Server:\t\tSecurity\r\r\n\tHandle ID:\t\t0x1ff8\r\r\n\r\r\nProcess Information:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\t\t0x1840\r\r\n\tProcess Name:\t\tC:\\Windows\\System32\\wuauclt.exe\r\nevt-00759|4656|2026-05-06T00:01:51.096Z|A handle to an object was requested.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-4107722679-1012484280-3777968168-1104\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tm.ward\r"]
